{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "id": "K",
  "meta": {
    "name": "龙脉裂隙",
    "node_type": "special_warp",
    "position": -1.0,
    "time_label": "无时间·裂隙之中",
    "parent_node_id": null,
    "trigger_condition": null
  },
  "scene": {
    "background": "/assets/bg/dragon_vein.jpg",
    "palette": "灰白虚空+暗红光脉",
    "ambient": null,
    "atmosphere": [
      "虚空",
      "无时间",
      "龙脉的搏动",
      "献祭与跃迁"
    ]
  },
  "entry_sequences": [
    {
      "id": "K.entry.default",
      "when": null,
      "priority": 0,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K.entry.default.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你踏入一片灰白色的虚空。脚下是一条暗红色的光脉——像血管，像河流，像一条被埋得太久的龙。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K.entry.default.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "八个方位各有一团大小不一的光。有些明亮，有些暗得几乎看不见。这些光团对应着八棺阵的八个方位——乾、兑、离、震、巽、坎、艮、坤。光团的亮度代表封印的完整程度。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K.entry.default.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "这里没有时间。良久与须臾是同一件事。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K.entry.default.paragraph.04.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "暗红色的光脉在你脚下缓慢搏动——不是你的心跳，是地底深处某种存在的脉搏。龙脉——广州地下的风水能量流。时间裂隙就是从龙脉的一处伤口中裂开的。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K.entry.default.paragraph.05.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你背包里的某些东西在微微发光——那些跨面道具。它们在这里有共鸣。你可以把它们献祭给暗下去的光团——用时间的力量修复时间的裂隙。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "K_choice_01",
      "label": "献祭道具修复光团（补阵）",
      "short_label": "献祭道具",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 1,
      "hint": "选择背包中的道具献祭给暗下去的光团，修复八棺阵的封印",
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_01.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你从背包中取出道具。它在龙脉裂隙中微微发光——比在地面上更亮。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_01.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你把它放在最暗的那团光下面。道具的发光在增强——然后道具本身开始变得透明，像是被光脉吸收了。最后一点实体的残余消散在灰白色的虚空中。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_01.result.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "对应的那团暗红色的光——亮了一些。不是很明显。但你知道封印被加固了极其微小的一丝。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_01.result.paragraph.04.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "八棺阵的封印就像一堵满是裂缝的墙。你每次只能补上薄薄的一层。但每补一层——下一轮循环中对应的节点就少一分异常。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "K",
        "mode": "stay"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_02",
      "label": "跃迁至A（荔湾广场正门）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→A",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 10,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_02.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你伸出手触碰正上方那团最亮的光。虚空在你周围崩塌——然后重新凝聚。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_02.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "脚下一实——是花岗岩台阶。夕阳洒在脸上。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_02.result.paragraph.03.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你站在荔湾广场正门前。手机上的日期是2018年7月15日，傍晚18:30。铜狮面朝内，沉默地盯着广场深处。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "A",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_03",
      "label": "跃迁至B（德星路出租屋）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→B",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 11,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_03.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "暗红色的光吞没了一切。再睁开眼时——你站在502室的门口。钥匙还在口袋里。门内传来水龙头低沉的\"咯——咯——\"声。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "B",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_04",
      "label": "跃迁至C（华林寺）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→C",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 12,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_04.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你跨出虚空——檀香和旧木头的味道扑面而来。华林寺的庭院里，青烟从香炉中笔直升起。那个扫地的老和尚抬头看了你一眼。他的眼神不像是看到一个人走进了寺门——更像是看到一个人从空气中凭空出现。但他什么都没说。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "C",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_05",
      "label": "跃迁至D（上下九步行街）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→D",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 13,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_05.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "霓虹灯的频闪。卤味和臭豆腐的气味。人潮从你身边流过——没有人注意到你刚刚从一道裂隙中走出来。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_05.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "上下九步行街的夜晚像往常一样嘈杂而拥挤。糖水铺角落里那个穿格子衬衫的男人抬起头——他在等你。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "D",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_06",
      "label": "跃迁至E（八棺之地）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→E",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 14,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_06.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "脚下一实——是青砖地面。八口棺材在应急灯的微光中沉默着。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_06.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "你从龙脉裂隙直接跳到了裂隙的正上方。这里的空气比任何地方都冷——因为这里离时间的伤口最近。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "E",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_07",
      "label": "跃迁至F（沙面珠江边）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→F",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 15,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_07.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "江风。榕树的气根在夜风中摆荡。珠江水面漆黑如墨，对岸的灯火在水面上扭曲。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_07.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "江边长椅上坐着一个穿灰色长衫的老人——他在钓鱼。他的鱼线没有伸进水里。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "F",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_08",
      "label": "跃迁至G（陈家祠）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→G",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 16,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_08.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "精美的砖雕和灰塑在阳光下静静地反射着岭南建筑的骄傲。陈家祠的庭院里很安静——今天没有太多游客。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_08.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "藏书楼在祠堂的最深处。那个不对外开放的区域里，有一本日记在等你。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "G",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "K_choice_09",
      "label": "跃迁至H（康王路归途）",
      "short_label": "跃迁→H",
      "condition": null,
      "locked_visibility": "show",
      "repeat_policy": "once_per_visit",
      "priority": 17,
      "hint": null,
      "result_blocks": [
        {
          "id": "K_choice_09.result.paragraph.01.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "昏黄的路灯。深夜的康王路几乎没有车。路边电线杆下有一堆烧纸钱的痕迹。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        },
        {
          "id": "K_choice_09.result.paragraph.02.01",
          "type": "narration",
          "text": "荔湾广场的穹顶在不远处——你知道终点就在那里。这一次你选择了从龙脉直接过来，跳过了很多路。但代价是——你的一部分理智被留在了虚空之中。",
          "speaker_id": null,
          "when": null
        }
      ],
      "effects": [],
      "next": {
        "node_id": "H",
        "mode": "warp"
      }
    }
  ],
